    \item Climate finance falls short by factor of \textbf{3–6×} for adaptation
    \item Immediate, deep, sustained action across all sectors is essential
  \end{itemize}
  \vspace{6pt}
  \colorbox{accent!30}{\parbox{0.92\linewidth}{%
    \fontsize{24}{32}\selectfont\color{white}
    \textbf{Urgency message}: The window is rapidly closing. Securing a livable future requires unprecedented cooperation now.}}
