  \begin{itemize}[itemsep=8pt]
    \item \textbf{43\%} GHG reduction by 2030 (vs. 2019) for 1.5C pathway
    \item Net zero CO2 by ~2050 to limit warming to 1.5C
    \item Remaining carbon budget from 2020: ~500 GtCO2 (50\% likelihood)
